OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies to start the night,
OL,7,Fhowever cloud will increase from the
OL,8,Fsouth after midnight, with patchy rain
OL,9,Fand drizzle by dawn. Chilly initially
OL,10,Fthen temperatures rising.
OL,11,FSoutheasterly winds freshening
OL,12,Fovernight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,15,Fstrongest gusts around coasts. Cloudy
OL,16,Finitially with an odd spot of rain
OL,17,Fpossible, although brighter spells
OL,18,Fpossible later. Rain arriving
OL,19,Fovernight. Feeling warm and muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
